Kansas QSO Party counties, from the sponsor table at ksqsoparty.org/info/counties.htm
Out of state each county is its own multiplier (FCONTEST sets MultipliersIsCounties).
In state every county maps to Ks: the first Kansas county logged is the Kansas multiplier.

